They're often annoying, and they can interfere with your ability
to go about your business something fierce.  They're not really
any threat in the sense of being able to *hurt* you in any way
you can't deal with at that stage of the game, though.  Okay,
I've heard things about Demogorgon.  But most of them seem
to have been put in the game purely to make you want to
stop playing NetHack and go do something more productive
with your time.

> > was pretty darn paranoid about Eeels, kraken and mind flayers so I
