So far I've been just avoiding most of the sea creatures, or
using a polearm (though that tactic bit me in a recent game
when I forgot to put my shield of reflection back on after
using the polearm, so I may change my mind about that).
I haven't yet added them to my genocide list.

Mind flayers, however, are a high-priority genocide.

> They're so slow that you can hit 3 times, back away,
